            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You become trained in kineticist class DC and impulse attack rolls. Choose one element to be your kinetic element (air, earth, fire, metal, water, or wood). You gain a kinetic aura and the RoE action, though you don't get to use an RoE or stance impulse when you take that action. You gain the RoE action. Your RoE does not automatically gain additional damage dice every four levels, instead requiring you to take the Improved RoE feat."
